sequenceDiagram
    participant POS
    participant DB as POS Database
    participant O as Outbox
    participant Q as Queue Worker
    participant CRM
    POS->>DB: Save item or transaction
    DB->>O: Record sync event
    O->>Q: Dispatch background job
    Q->>CRM: Send signed request
    CRM-->>Q: Receipt or error
    Q->>O: Mark success or retry

